WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Compliance happens in motion. Execute regulated work through valid, evidenced states.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Attach rules to every state.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Require evidence before transition.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Route approvals and deadlines.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Refuse invalid handoffs.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Let the rules travel with the work.
